      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4020702",
      "subQuestName": "Go see Aino",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "402070201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "402070201": {
            "id": "402070201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, Ineffa! Oh, Jahoda! You're here, too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070202"
            ]
          },
          "402070202": {
            "id": "402070202",
            "speakerId": 1317,
            "speakerName": "Jahoda",
            "text": "Well, after all that hard work, I at least deserve a slice of cake for my efforts, don't you think?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070203"
            ]
          },
          "402070203": {
            "id": "402070203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, there's cake!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070204"
            ]
          },
          "402070204": {
            "id": "402070204",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Yes. You two are here just in time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070205"
            ]
          },
          "402070205": {
            "id": "402070205",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Aino wanted to thank you for your help, so now that Krum-Clank is back safe and sound, she thought it would be nice for everyone to try out his baking.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070206"
            ]
          },
          "402070206": {
            "id": "402070206",
            "speakerId": 15535,
            "speakerName": "Krum-Clank 70% Sweet",
            "text": "Clank... clank...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070207"
            ]
          },
          "402070207": {
            "id": "402070207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow, so this is what Krum-Clank was supposed to look like!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070208"
            ]
          },
          "402070208": {
            "id": "402070208",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Yes. Luckily, the core was still intact, so all Aino had to do was make a new body.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070209"
            ]
          },
          "402070209": {
            "id": "402070209",
            "speakerId": 15535,
            "speakerName": "Krum-Clank 70% Sweet",
            "text": "Clank... clank...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070210"
            ]
          },
          "402070210": {
            "id": "402070210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh, is it ready?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070211"
            ]
          },
          "402070211": {
            "id": "402070211",
            "speakerId": 15535,
            "speakerName": "Krum-Clank 70% Sweet",
            "text": "Gulp...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070212"
            ]
          },
          "402070212": {
            "id": "402070212",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, he ate it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070213"
            ]
          },
          "402070213": {
            "id": "402070213",
            "speakerId": 1317,
            "speakerName": "Jahoda",
            "text": "It's not unusual for a chef to take a few bites before serving a dish.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070214"
            ]
          },
          "402070214": {
            "id": "402070214",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "No need to worry. Once he's had his fill, he can get started on the desserts for everyone else. It'll just be a moment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070215"
            ]
          },
          "402070215": {
            "id": "402070215",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Alright... Wait, speaking of desserts, where's Aino?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070216"
            ]
          },
          "402070216": {
            "id": "402070216",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Ah, she thought of a new idea for a robot and shut herself in the workshop to get started. When inspiration strikes, she jumps into action. That's just who she is.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070217"
            ]
          },
          "402070217": {
            "id": "402070217",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Why does Aino like building robots so much?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070218"
            ]
          },
          "402070218": {
            "id": "402070218",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Hm... Retrieving historical records from data bank...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070219"
            ]
          },
          "402070219": {
            "id": "402070219",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "At first, I believe Aino was just shocked to find something that fascinated her more than desserts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070220"
            ]
          },
          "402070220": {
            "id": "402070220",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "And fortunately, her friends respected her passion — even if, aside from struggling to make ends meet, there was little time for much else.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070221"
            ]
          },
          "402070221": {
            "id": "402070221",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Then, one day, an acclaimed teacher discovered her and recognized her passion for what it truly was... genius.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070222"
            ]
          },
          "402070222": {
            "id": "402070222",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Just like her friends, she finally discovered what she wanted to do. And not only that, she excelled at it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070223"
            ]
          },
          "402070223": {
            "id": "402070223",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "And when genius and passion collide, there's not much that can get in the way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070224"
            ]
          },
          "402070224": {
            "id": "402070224",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "So, Aino left her childhood friends, established the Clink-Clank Krumkake Craftshop, and started making all kinds of robot companions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070225"
            ]
          },
          "402070225": {
            "id": "402070225",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Perhaps it all comes down to the natural instinct of a genius... the drive to see their imagination come to life.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070226"
            ]
          },
          "402070226": {
            "id": "402070226",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh... So that's what draws her to robotics?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070227"
            ]
          },
          "402070227": {
            "id": "402070227",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Based on my own experience with Aino, I think there's more to it than that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070228"
            ]
          },
          "402070228": {
            "id": "402070228",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Long before she took me in, she was already pushing her skills to the limit in an effort to give each robot a distinct personality, and she already treated them like companions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070229"
            ]
          },
          "402070229": {
            "id": "402070229",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "What I mean is, it's not something that started with me, just because I have a unique background.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070230"
            ]
          },
          "402070230": {
            "id": "402070230",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "I think, after walking the path of a genius for so long, she looked around and realized there was no one at her side, and it made her feel lonely.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070231"
            ]
          },
          "402070231": {
            "id": "402070231",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "So, me, Krum-Clank, and all the other robots Aino has added to the workshop... We're not just proof of her genius.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070232"
            ]
          },
          "402070232": {
            "id": "402070232",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "We're her family. We give her the companionship she longs for.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070233"
            ]
          },
          "402070233": {
            "id": "402070233",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "As I see it, that's the true relationship between Aino and her robots.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070234"
            ]
          },
          "402070234": {
            "id": "402070234",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, wow. So, you really mean a lot to her...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070235"
            ]
          },
          "402070235": {
            "id": "402070235",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Yes. And for that reason, it did not matter to Aino how powerful Krum-Clank could become, nor how feared or coveted his technology might be among the factions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070236"
            ]
          },
          "402070236": {
            "id": "402070236",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "And she decided that he would join this family, and that meant she would spare no effort to save him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070237"
            ]
          },
          "402070237": {
            "id": "402070237",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, that makes sense! But, it makes Paimon wonder why someone like Aino would choose to stay in Nod-Krai...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070238"
            ]
          },
          "402070238": {
            "id": "402070238",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "...I'm afraid my logic unit cannot make sense of that question.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070239"
            ]
          },
          "402070239": {
            "id": "402070239",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, the way Paimon sees it, Nod-Krai is a dog-eat-dog place full of scheming and scamming. The people that thrive here seem to be built for that kind of thing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070240"
            ]
          },
          "402070240": {
            "id": "402070240",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Anyone else would use the kind of tech Aino has to make weapons and threaten people.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070241"
            ]
          },
          "402070241": {
            "id": "402070241",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But Aino... she takes something that could be a weapon and turns it into a robot that makes cakes. It just doesn't seem like she fits in...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070242"
            ]
          },
          "402070242": {
            "id": "402070242",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "No, my view is the exact opposite.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070243"
            ]
          },
          "402070243": {
            "id": "402070243",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "I've encountered the full spectrum of people that live here in Nod-Krai. But, in my experience, very few of them can be said to represent this place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070244"
            ]
          },
          "402070244": {
            "id": "402070244",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "You say Aino doesn't fit in here, but I believe the opposite. If I were to attempt to define what a person from Nod-Krai should be... no one is a better match than Aino.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070245"
            ]
          },
          "402070245": {
            "id": "402070245",
            "speakerId": 15535,
            "speakerName": "Krum-Clank 70% Sweet",
            "text": "Ding... Ding...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070246"
            ]
          },
          "402070246": {
            "id": "402070246",
            "speakerId": 1313,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "Ooh, the desserts should be done!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070247"
            ]
          },
          "402070247": {
            "id": "402070247",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Yes. One moment. Allow me to serve them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070248"
            ]
          },
          "402070248": {
            "id": "402070248",
            "speakerId": 1313,
            "speakerName": "Aino",
            "text": "I want the one with the most frosting!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070249"
            ]
          },
          "402070249": {
            "id": "402070249",
            "speakerId": 1312,
            "speakerName": "Ineffa",
            "text": "Alright, everyone. Dig in.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402070250"
            ]
          },
          "402070250": {
            "id": "402070250",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Mmm! So worth it!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}